This repository contains data from the Hatchery to Harvest project funded by the Alaska Fisheries Development Fund 2024 Joint Innovation Project program.

Data was collected at approximately three time points:

1. During kelp growth and development in the hatchery (ALL_Kodiak_Microscope_Sporophyte_Sizes, ALL_Slide_gam_lengths, 2026_Kodiak_Microscope_Percent_Cover)
2. Less than 48 hours before transferring kelp from the hatchery and outplanting it on the farm (ALL_Spool_Cover, ALL_Kodiak_Outplant_Sporophyte_Sizes)
3. At the harvest of kelp from the farm (ALL_Kodiak_Harvest_Measurements, ALL_Kodiak_Harvest_Weights)

Please refer to the Methods file for a description of methods used to collect data.
